#: manifest.json
msgid "Chapters, Bookmarks and A-B Loop"
msgstr "章节、书签与区段"

#: manifest.json
msgid "Jump by chapter and bookmark; loop an A-B range"
msgstr "按章节和书签跳转，A-B 区段循环"

#: manifest.json
msgid ""
"Lists the media's chapters; adds, names and manages bookmarks for each file; jumps between chapters and bookmarks and shows them as marks on the seek bar; sets an A-B range and loops it a chosen number of times.\n"
"Find it in the context menu under \"Playback ▸ Chapters and Bookmarks\" and \"Playback ▸ A-B Loop\"."
msgstr ""
"列出媒体的章节，为每个文件添加、命名和管理书签，在章节与书签之间跳转并在进度条上显示标记；设定 A-B 区段并按次数循环播放。\n"
"入口在右键菜单「播放 ▶ 章节/书签」与「播放 ▶ A-B 区段循环」。"

#: manifest.json
msgid "Playback"
msgstr "播放"

#: manifest.json
msgid "Chapters"
msgstr "章节"

#: manifest.json
